oto-1516549655169-df83a0774514?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400","location":"Pune"},{"id":5,"link":"#","name":"Rural Health Mission","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505751172876-fa1923c5c528?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400","location":"Rajasthan"}]}', 'USR-001', '2026-08-01 09:08:17', '2026-08-19 14:06:57'),
(3, 'global', 'programs', '[{"id":1,"icon":"graduation-cap","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541339907198-e08756dedf3f?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800","title":"KNT GLOBAL UNIVERSITY","detail":{"quote":"Education is the most powerful weapon which you can use to change the world.","objectives":["To establish a world-class educational hub accessible to all.","To promote advanced research in science, technology, and humanities.","To build a globally recognized faculty and student exchange program."],"budgetAreas":["Land and Infrastructure Development","Research Laboratories and Equipment","Digital Library and IT Infrastructure","Scholarships and Endowment Funds"],"futureVision":"The future vision for KNT Global University is to rank among the top 100 universities worldwide, producing graduates who are not only academically proficient but also deeply rooted in values and social responsibility.","introduction":"KNT Global University is conceived as a premier global institution designed to nurture future leaders through world-class education, research, and innovation. Set across a massive 10,000-acre campus, it aims to provide an ecosystem where academic excellence meets holistic character development.","keyFocusAreas":["Global Academic Standards","State-of-the-Art Research","Holistic Student Development","International Collaborations","Sustainable Campus"],"expectedImpact":["Empower thousands of students with global standard education.","Create a hub for breakthrough research and innovation.","Generate widespread employment opportunities in the education sector."],"implementationPlan":["Phase 1: Land acquisition and master planning.","Phase 2: Construction of core academic blocks and hostels.","Phase 3: Faculty recruitment and international partnerships.","Phase 4: Launch of undergraduate and postgraduate programs."]},"description":"A 10,000 acre world-class university offering quality education, research and global opportunities."},{"id":2,"icon":"sprout","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596733430284-f74372752061?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800","title":"MEGA GAUSHALA & COW RESEARCH UNIVERSITY","detail":{"quote":"Compassion for animals is intimately associated with goodness of character.","objectives":["To provide a safe, healthy, and loving environment for thousands of cows.","To conduct scientific research on cow-based agriculture and health products.","To train farmers in sustainable, chemical-free organic farming."],"budgetAreas":["Shelter Construction and Maintenance","Veterinary Medical Equipment","Fodder Procurement and Farming","Research and Academic Facilities"],"futureVision":"To become a global center of excellence for cow science and sustainable living, demonstrating how traditional ecological practices can solve modern agricultural and environmental challenges.","introduction":"The Mega Gaushala & Cow Research University project is a pioneering initiative dedicated to the protection, welfare, and scientific study of cows. It integrates traditional wisdom with modern veterinary science to promote Ayurveda, sustainable organic farming, and animal welfare on an unprecedented scale.","keyFocusAreas":["Cow Shelter & Welfare","Veterinary Research & Care","Ayurvedic Medicine Production","Organic Farming Training","Sustainable Biogas Energy"],"expectedImpact":["Rescue and rehabilitate thousands of stray and abandoned cows.","Promote natural farming, leading to healthier crops and soil.","Create a self-sustaining ecosystem powered by biogas and organic manure."],"implementationPlan":["Design and construct eco-friendly cow shelters with modern amenities.","Establish a dedicated veterinary hospital and research labs.","Set up biogas plants for renewable energy generation.","Launch academic courses on cow science and organic agriculture."]},"description":"World''s largest Gaushala with research university for cow science, Ayurveda & sustainable farming."},{"id":3,"icon":"baby","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1488521787991-ed7bbaae773c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800","title":"ANATHALAYA CITY","detail":{"quote":"Service becomes powerful when vision, planning and action work together.","objectives":["To create a scalable and transparent service model.","To serve vulnerable communities with dignity and discipline.","To document progress and improve operational efficiency every year."],"budgetAreas":["Infrastructure and Site Development","Equipment and Necessary Technology","Human Resources and Specialized Training","Operations, Maintenance, and Monitoring"],"futureVision":"The future vision is to develop a disciplined, measurable, and inspirational project that can expand from local service to district, state, national, and global levels. The goal is not only to start an activity, but to create a sustainable model that can serve humanity for generations.","introduction":"This project is a core part of our mission to deliver high-quality, impactful service to vulnerable communities. It is designed with deep empathy and strict operational discipline to ensure long-term, scalable welfare.","keyFocusAreas":["Community Engagement","Resource Allocation","Sustainable Operations","Impact Measurement","Strategic Partnerships"],"expectedImpact":["Direct, measurable support to vulnerable beneficiaries.","Improved access to essential services and opportunities.","Stronger community trust and documented progress for authorities."],"implementationPlan":["Survey the target area and identify beneficiaries.","Prepare site plan, resources, staff, and partner list.","Execute pilot activities, document photographs and feedback.","Scale the model phase-wise with strict budget discipline."]},"description":"A model city for orphans providing education, care, values and a bright future."},{"id":4,"icon":"users","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516281788220-43eb25a6f2bd?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800","title":"VRIDDHA ASHRAM","detail":{"quote":"Service becomes powerful when